        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Balls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create. Customize. Battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Balls is a physics-based arena brawler where you design your own spinning warriors and send it into chaotic fights. Choose your weapon, adjust spin speed, damage, and health, then watch as your creations bounce, slash, and smash their way through the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ball fights on its own, so your strategy is in the build. Will you go for fast and fragile? Or slow and unstoppable?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable battle balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from weapons like daggers, axes, and shurikens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable stats: spin speed, damage, and health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic real-time arena battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 fighters on screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple interface, deep strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the perfect fighters, drop them into the chaos, and see if your Battle Ball can survive the arena.</p>",
